{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-common-biology-40","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"biology","number":40,"points":2,"unitId":"ecology","unitLabel":"진화·생태·행동","topic":"계통수","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["ecology"],"stem":"다음은 절지동물문(phylum Arthropoda)을 구성하고 있는 주요 \n분류군 중, 4 개 아문(subphylum)의 계통수와 각 아문에 속하는\n일부 동물을 나열한 것이다.\n위의 계통유연관계에 근거한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는\n대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 탈피(ecdysis)하는 특성은 A와 B의 공유조상형질이다.\nㄴ. 기체 교환을 위한 기관계(tracheal system)는 B의 공유파생\n형질이다.\nㄷ. 육상생활을 하는 모든 절지동물은 단계통군을 형성한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":1,"acceptedAnswers":[1],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":663,"height":223,"region":0,"bbox":[37.08,75.443,265.2,89.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-common-biology-40/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":226,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,231.843,310.4,90.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-common-biology-40/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":21,"sourceRect":[430.12,484.157,759.1,858.622],"width":328.98,"height":374.465,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[37.08,75.443,265.2,89.2],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.28,231.843,310.4,90.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"40. 다음은 절지동물문(phylum Arthropoda)을 구성하고 있는 주요 ","bbox":[5.0,5.0,323.08,12.276],"spans":[{"text":"40.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.421,12.276],"origin":[5.0,14.024],"size":11.696,"flags":4,"font":"*ÇÑ¾